CPO Magazine reports Vimeo's confirmation of the breach. Security Affairs reports ShinyHunters exploiting the Anodot incident to target Vimeo. SC Media reports customer data accessed following the Anodot breach. Have I Been Pwned carries the Vimeo breach record, and the page gives Have I Been Pwned's count of about 119,000 unique email addresses. The MITRE page defines T1199, Trusted Relationship, which the page maps to stages 01 and 03.

In its text, the page also credits BleepingComputer's April 28 report for the date of the listing.

The background slides name their own sources: MITRE ATT&CK, the csoh.org glossary and Google Cloud's BigQuery documentation.

