At stage 05, the page says DBeaver, custom scripts and standard compression are the same profile as UNC5537 / Snowflake two years earlier. That chain has its own kill chain page.

The four defense topics the page links are data security and KMS, SaaS security, non-human identity, and detection engineering. KMS stands for key management service, and SSPM for SaaS security posture management.
